WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.367
-Jimmy, show's about to start.
You ready?

00:00:03.367 --> 00:00:07.167
-Ooh, not only am I ready,
I am freaking out!

00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:08.367
-Yeah, it should be pretty good.

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:10.567
-Ralph Macchio, Jennifer Beals,

00:00:10.567 --> 00:00:13.234
Lea Thompson,
music from Modern English.

00:00:13.234 --> 00:00:15.701
This is gonna be the best
'80s show ever!

00:00:15.701 --> 00:00:16.834
-All right, all right, Jimmy.

00:00:16.834 --> 00:00:18.801
You're getting a little crazy.

00:00:18.801 --> 00:00:23.300
-Not only am I '80s crazy,
I'm a maniac.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.067
[ "Maniac" plays ]

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:26.434
-Oh, no.

00:00:26.434 --> 00:00:29.133
♪♪

00:00:29.133 --> 00:00:31.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:40.868
♪♪

00:00:40.868 --> 00:00:43.868
-♪ Just a steel-town girl
on a Saturday night ♪

00:00:43.868 --> 00:00:46.901
♪ Lookin' for
the fight of her life ♪

00:00:46.901 --> 00:00:50.067
♪ In the real time world,
no one sees her at all ♪

00:00:50.067 --> 00:00:54.000
♪ They all say she's crazy ♪

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.000
♪ It can cut you like a knife ♪

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.334
♪ If the gift
becomes the fire ♪

00:01:00.334 --> 00:01:04.834
♪ On a wire between
will and what will be ♪

00:01:04.834 --> 00:01:09.200
♪ She's a maniac,
maniac on the floor ♪

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:10.901
♪♪

00:01:10.901 --> 00:01:12.334
♪ And she's dancing like -- ♪♪

00:01:12.334 --> 00:01:15.000
[ "Old Time Rock &amp; Roll" plays ]
Whoa, whoa.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.634
Higgins, shirt's a little short,

00:01:16.634 --> 00:01:18.868
but, overall,
pretty good for the '80s show.

00:01:18.868 --> 00:01:20.467
